WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.184
Report hazards, near misses, injuries, and damaged equipment promptly.

2
00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:10.141
Give clear facts: the location, the hazard, the immediate control, and who

3
00:00:10.141 --> 00:00:11.793
needs to follow up.

4
00:00:11.793 --> 00:00:14.862
Do not include unnecessary personal information.

5
00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:18.505
A report is useful only when someone owns the action and checks

6
00:00:18.505 --> 00:00:20.023
that the risk is controlled.

7
00:00:20.023 --> 00:00:23.584
Pause and think: Who receives a hazard report on your shift?
